return {h=18,w=888,cr=60,hc=20,bh=35,gr="slow",eg={"water2"},st={70,120,40,95,40,95},ab={{24,0},{3,1}},genus={en="Brutal Pokémon",es="Pokémon Voraz",pt="Pokémon Brutal"},flavor={en={[7]="Nicknamed “the bully of the sea,” SHARPEDO is widely feared. Its cruel fangs grow back immediately if they snap off. Just one of these Pokémon can thoroughly tear apart a supertanker.",[8]="SHARPEDO can swim at speeds of up to 75 mph by jetting seawater out of its backside. This Pokémon’s drawback is its inability to swim long distances.",[9]="The vicious and sly gangster of the sea. Its skin is specially textured to minimize drag in water. Its speed tops out at over 75 miles per hour.",[10]="The ruffian of the seas, it has fangs that crunch through iron. It swims by jetting water from its rear.",[11]="The ruffian of the seas, it has fangs that crunch through iron. It swims by jetting water from its rear.",[12]="Its fangs rip through sheet iron. It swims at 75 mph and is known as “The Bully of the Sea.”",[13]="Its fangs rip through sheet iron. It swims at 75 mph and is known as “The Bully of the Sea.”",[14]="Its fangs rip through sheet iron. It swims at 75 mph and is known as “The Bully of the Sea.”",[15]="It can swim at speeds of 75 mph by jetting seawater through its body. It is the bandit of the sea.",[16]="It can swim at speeds of 75 mph by jetting seawater through its body. It is the bandit of the sea.",[17]="Its fangs rip through sheet iron. It swims at 75 mph and is known as “The Bully of the Sea.”",[18]="Its fangs rip through sheet iron. It swims at 75 mph and is known as “The Bully of the Sea.”",[21]="Its fangs rip through sheet iron. It swims at 75 mph and is known as “The Bully of the Sea.”",[22]="Its fangs rip through sheet iron. It swims at 75 mph and is known as “The Bully of the Sea.”",[23]="Its fangs rip through sheet iron. It swims at 75 mph and is known as “The Bully of the Sea.”",[24]="It can swim at speeds of 75 mph by jetting seawater through its body. It is the bandit of the sea.",[25]="Nicknamed “the bully of the sea,” Sharpedo is widely feared. Its cruel fangs grow back immediately if they snap off. Just one of these Pokémon can thoroughly tear apart a supertanker.",[26]="Sharpedo can swim at speeds of up to 75 mph by jetting seawater out of its backside. This Pokémon’s drawback is its inability to swim long distances.",[27]="It pursues its prey at speeds of 75 mph and finishes them off with fangs that can crush iron. It is known as the bully of the sea.",[28]="It has a sad history. In the past, its dorsal fin was a treasured foodstuff, so this Pokémon became a victim of overfishing.",[29]="People believe that carrying one of its discarded fangs will prevent mishaps at sea, so the fangs are made into accessories.",[30]="It drinks in seawater and jets it from its rear to propel itself. It’s very sensitive to the scent of blood.",[33]="As soon as it catches the scent of prey, Sharpedo will jet seawater from its backside, hurtling toward the target to attack at 75 mph.",[34]="This Pokémon is known as the Bully of the Sea. Any ship entering the waters Sharpedo calls home will be attacked, no exceptions."},es={[23]="Con sus colmillos puede atravesar el acero. Nada a 120 km/h. Le llaman el Terror de los Mares.",[24]="Propulsándose con sus aletas, nada a 120 km/h. Es el terror de los mares.",[25]="Conocido como el Terror de los Mares, Sharpedo es temido por todos. Si este Pokémon pierde los escalofriantes colmillos que tiene, los recupera en breve. Basta con un Sharpedo para destrozar un buque-cisterna.",[26]="Sharpedo puede alcanzar nadando los 120 km/h agitando la aleta trasera y propulsándose por el agua. El punto flaco de este Pokémon es la imposibilidad que tiene de nadar largas distancias.",[27]="Puede nadar a 120 km/h y abatir a su presa con sus colmillos, capaces de destrozar incluso el metal. Su apodo es el Terror de los Mares.",[28]="Este Pokémon tiene un pasado triste, ya que antaño fue pescado en exceso por lo deliciosa que era su aleta dorsal.",[29]="Existe la creencia de que sus dientes traen buena suerte en la mar, por lo que se usan para la elaboración de amuletos y adornos.",[30]="Nada tragando agua marina, que le sirve de propulsión al expelerla por detrás. Su olfato es extremadamente sensible al olor de la sangre.",[33]="En cuanto detecta el olor de una presa, expele agua marina para propulsarse hacia delante y atacar a una velocidad de 120 km/h.",[34]="Conocido como el Terror de los Mares, ataca sin excepción a todo barco que ose adentrarse en su territorio oceánico."},pt="Este Pokémon é conhecido como o Valentão do Mar. Qualquer navio que entre nas águas onde Sharpedo vive será atacado, sem exceção."},evo={{s=318},{s=319,from=318,c={{t="level-up",lv=30}}}},moves={[5]={1,43,1,44,1,99,1,116,7,99,13,116,16,184,22,242,28,103,33,163,38,269,43,207,48,130,53,97},[6]={1,43,1,44,1,99,1,116,7,99,13,116,16,184,22,242,28,103,33,163,38,269,43,207,48,130,53,97},[7]={1,43,1,44,1,99,1,116,7,99,13,116,16,184,22,242,28,103,33,163,38,269,43,207,48,130,53,97},[8]={1,43,1,44,1,99,1,116,6,99,8,116,11,184,16,423,18,103,21,207,26,372,28,242,30,163,34,453,40,269,45,97,50,130,56,400},[9]={1,364,1,43,1,44,1,99,1,116,6,99,8,116,11,184,16,423,18,103,21,207,26,372,28,242,30,163,34,453,40,269,45,97,50,130,56,400},[10]={1,364,1,43,1,44,1,99,1,116,6,99,8,116,11,184,16,423,18,103,21,207,26,372,28,242,30,163,34,453,40,269,45,97,50,130,56,400},[11]={1,364,1,43,1,44,1,99,1,116,6,99,8,116,11,184,16,423,18,103,21,207,26,372,28,242,30,163,34,453,40,269,45,97,50,130,56,400},[12]={1,43,1,44,1,99,1,116,7,99,13,116,16,184,22,242,28,103,33,163,38,269,43,207,48,130,53,97},[13]={1,43,1,44,1,99,1,116,7,99,13,116,16,184,22,242,28,103,33,163,38,269,43,207,48,130,53,97},[14]={1,364,1,43,1,44,1,99,1,116,6,99,8,116,11,184,16,423,18,103,21,207,26,372,28,242,30,163,34,453,40,269,45,97,50,130,56,400},[15]={1,400,1,364,1,43,1,44,1,99,1,116,6,99,8,116,11,184,16,423,18,103,21,207,26,372,28,242,30,163,34,453,40,269,45,97,50,1